{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waterpark Simulator is a first-person management simulator. Design, build, and manage your own waterpark. From crazy slides to tasty snacks, every detail is yours to control.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/fd62cf65607ba0a9826e2412b298eac9.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/fd62cf65607ba0a9826e2412b298eac9.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom waterslides, unique pools, themed attractions, and everything else a fun, functional waterpark needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/168390bee59a471a395eea831453d27d.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/168390bee59a471a395eea831453d27d.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray your guests with water guns, launch beach balls at their heads, or maybe give a nervous diver a \u201cgentle\u201d push off the board.  It\u2019s your park  you make the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/e9af81b5588f36477195675eaeb5a5f9.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/e9af81b5588f36477195675eaeb5a5f9.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning, it\u2019s all on you. From selling tickets, serving food, saving drowning guests, fixing broken slides, cleaning up after visitors, to scooping poop out of the pool. It\u2019s chaotic, hands-on, and all part of running a successful waterpark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/caf04057b5d259ee95d62a56e5f4f732.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/caf04057b5d259ee95d62a56e5f4f732.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint walls and slides, spray custom designs onto any surface, and swap out flooring to set the tone of each area. Add props, signs, and decorations to give your park a personal touch and make every corner feel uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2dfff5275b3c2117634da21a0edeee28.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/2dfff5275b3c2117634da21a0edeee28.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch guests into the air, send them flying into pools, or watch them flop helplessly after slipping on a puddle. Ragdoll physics turn every moment into a potential comedy highlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/4a698a9d217c00e1f6ed11dfeef0e43d.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/4a698a9d217c00e1f6ed11dfeef0e43d.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your guests happy by setting up food stands and vending machines around your park. Prepare hot dogs, lemonade, ice cream and more! The better the treats, the happier the visitors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/91089dac5a54c5c17c41bcee42637084.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/91089dac5a54c5c17c41bcee42637084.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you do affects your park\u2019s overall rating from how clean it is, to how fun your slides are, to the quality of your food and amenities. The happier your guests are, the better your rating. Keep them satisfied and they\u2019ll stay longer, spend more, and want to come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/f61e509a73e5c6770fc343482e718bc7.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/f61e509a73e5c6770fc343482e718bc7.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park gets more popular, it\u2019s time to expand. Unlock new areas to grow your waterpark\u2019s size and hire staff to handle the daily chaos. With a team in place, you can focus on what really matters: building the best waterpark possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the making of this game.\u00a0We pay artists for all our assets and marketing images/ videos, translation teams, devs, etc. We are proud to be a 100% human-made game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nailed it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/b29225d919bc8e3dfcfc42a0eed5dedcaaf3a635.jpg"},{"name":"Screw it! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/bc0d2e85cd938dd69de88b61d9e82d1bea77f486.jpg"},{"name":"One-Star Wonder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/e14847323817b38ad8fab21024e3885547699785.jpg"},{"name":"Double Shine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/a76e26ab731244e03bb98d500895bdc27982fa36.jpg"},{"name":"Three-Star Standard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/cb0f1cbcb773e7260391918ee5cf40efd7e452d8.jpg"},{"name":"Almost a Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/8806184bf6ae25d1106423da18589c27e6acc6bb.jpg"},{"name":"Crowned in Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/b4b14321ac168f905088aa807454fd754042b431.jpg"},{"name":"Mop it like it\u2019s hot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/383770318b7342ee06fa6d6865bd26f033756c69.jpg"},{"name":"Mopocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/4ac67c556e4bf44f52b8ccfe82c7adac2c692b62.jpg"},{"name":"Thou shall not slip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3293260/b7eb34181d5d043f95749eb0359932c32e3fe424.jpg"}],"total":59},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293260?t=1772637886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/0f746206fc68d2513df711ad1142587f215277a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772637886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/24e05b048ee00a0efedad2dfa8cf34093dfc177a/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1772637886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/24e05b048ee00a0efedad2dfa8cf34093dfc177a/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1772637886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3730180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/b520485bff4ad403d4ea389daea2d10c.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/b520485bff4ad403d4ea389daea2d10c.avif?t=1772637886 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waterpark Simulator is a first-person management simulator. Design, build, and manage your own waterpark. From crazy slides to tasty snacks, every detail is yours to control.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/fd62cf65607ba0a9826e2412b298eac9.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/fd62cf65607ba0a9826e2412b298eac9.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2e46f673c6411a3d428ab4eb85c4e8c3.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom waterslides, unique pools, themed attractions, and everything else a fun, functional waterpark needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/168390bee59a471a395eea831453d27d.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/168390bee59a471a395eea831453d27d.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3ad3d8c70b68f52587e8d28cf7b5c805.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray your guests with water guns, launch beach balls at their heads, or maybe give a nervous diver a \u201cgentle\u201d push off the board.  It\u2019s your park  you make the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/e9af81b5588f36477195675eaeb5a5f9.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/e9af81b5588f36477195675eaeb5a5f9.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/1c76db301ab389ef32612f8337ef86de.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning, it\u2019s all on you. From selling tickets, serving food, saving drowning guests, fixing broken slides, cleaning up after visitors, to scooping poop out of the pool. It\u2019s chaotic, hands-on, and all part of running a successful waterpark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/caf04057b5d259ee95d62a56e5f4f732.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/caf04057b5d259ee95d62a56e5f4f732.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/06281a6e8efd082957fa4d7c12b5b656.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint walls and slides, spray custom designs onto any surface, and swap out flooring to set the tone of each area. Add props, signs, and decorations to give your park a personal touch and make every corner feel uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2dfff5275b3c2117634da21a0edeee28.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/2dfff5275b3c2117634da21a0edeee28.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a8e971ca9cb66fcf9bc60b84694200f4.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch guests into the air, send them flying into pools, or watch them flop helplessly after slipping on a puddle. Ragdoll physics turn every moment into a potential comedy highlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/4a698a9d217c00e1f6ed11dfeef0e43d.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/4a698a9d217c00e1f6ed11dfeef0e43d.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/2356402d0f406debc5e2efc20b63e34c.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your guests happy by setting up food stands and vending machines around your park. Prepare hot dogs, lemonade, ice cream and more! The better the treats, the happier the visitors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/91089dac5a54c5c17c41bcee42637084.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/91089dac5a54c5c17c41bcee42637084.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/a46dfd9e6ae3b36bb54d122decb0b7f8.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you do affects your park\u2019s overall rating from how clean it is, to how fun your slides are, to the quality of your food and amenities. The happier your guests are, the better your rating. Keep them satisfied and they\u2019ll stay longer, spend more, and want to come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/f61e509a73e5c6770fc343482e718bc7.avif?t=1772637886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras_big/f61e509a73e5c6770fc343482e718bc7.avif?t=1772637886 width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/ddfdc8515a689035936c33627c89d501.mp4?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park gets more popular, it\u2019s time to expand. Unlock new areas to grow your waterpark\u2019s size and hire staff to handle the daily chaos. With a team in place, you can focus on what really matters: building the best waterpark possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.poster.avif?t=1772637886\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.webm?t=1772637886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the making of this game.\u00a0We pay artists for all our assets and marketing images/ videos, translation teams, devs, etc. We are proud to be a 100% human-made game.</p>","developers":["CayPlay"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/911c613bb4443